WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.610
Meet your agent

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:12.530
Give it a task — it finishes on its own

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:23.770
It spots the repeat

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:31.340
One tap makes it an app

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:38.200
A deletion waits for you

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:44.440
Approve it — done exactly as approved

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:49.440
The morning brief

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:58.880
The same agent, on the phone
